languages/structure.md:24:16: personified-verb: "The note" is not a person or a program and cannot "say"; make the program or person that acts the subject, or use a verb such as "holds", "marks", "declares" or "determines"
languages/structure.md:24:21: self-reference: the sentence ends on "says so", which points back instead of stating the fact; state the fact itself
